  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide life-saving food assistance to vulnerable people living in areas controlled by armed gangs in the Port au Prince metropolitan area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to ensure food access through food assistance to people affected by gang violence in the Cit&#xE9; Soleil area. This WFP project provides 378 MT of in-kind food assistance to 28,560 people, and 2) US$ 713,760 in cash vouchers to 14,820 people among other activities. The project provides life-saving assistance to 43,380 people, including 8,850 women, 9,140 men, 25,390 children, and 3,037 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
